#
# EXCEPTION (2026-09-16): the small paper's PRIMARY EVIDENCE must never be lost.
# The blanket rule above is how the Phase-1 JSONs (paired_bc_vs_expert_500.json,
# asap_baseline.json, fire_oracle_dist2_3k_60.json) disappeared: only prose
# copies survived in docs/. Every eval JSON now carries a run_meta identity
# block, so these files are self-describing and safe to track. Keep the
# blanket ignore for ad-hoc evals; track the E-numbered queue explicitly.
!results/shoot_eval/E1_*.json
!results/shoot_eval/E2_*.json
!results/shoot_eval/E3_*.json
!results/shoot_eval/E5_*.json
!results/shoot_eval/E6_*.json
!results/shoot_eval/E7_*.json
# Regenerable rule-expert dataset (scripts/generate_shoot_rule_expert.py --seed 42)
data/expert/shoot_rule_expert*.npz
